WEBVTT

00:11.960 --> 00:13.980
The princess has returned!

00:14.930 --> 00:17.520
She's in the courtyard with Lady Euphyllia.

00:31.800 --> 00:33.110
Anis!

00:47.090 --> 00:50.010
I don't want to let you become queen.

00:50.010 --> 00:53.110
I don't want to let you give up everything.

00:55.780 --> 00:57.250
So...

00:59.620 --> 01:01.210
Let's settle this.

01:01.990 --> 01:04.960
The Magical Revolution

01:01.990 --> 01:04.960
The Magical Revolution

01:01.990 --> 01:04.960
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

01:35.440 --> 01:37.570
You deserve to be rewarded.

01:38.530 --> 01:41.710
I mean, you've been through so much pain!

01:41.710 --> 01:45.710
You could have freedom from now on 
and live the way you want!

01:47.460 --> 01:51.260
So there's no need for you to take my place!

01:51.680 --> 01:53.640
Yes, you're right.

01:54.160 --> 01:56.300
There is no replacement for you.

01:56.730 --> 01:59.390
Who could ever hope to take your place?

02:01.540 --> 02:05.190
Miss Anis, I believe in you.

02:05.730 --> 02:13.140
Your dream, your magic, 
can fly so much higher and farther.

02:13.990 --> 02:16.510
Your day is yet to come.

02:16.510 --> 02:19.950
When it does, I want to live it with you.

02:19.950 --> 02:24.150
I don't want to sacrifice you 
to make my dream come true!

02:24.550 --> 02:27.120
You don't have to go through that for me!

02:27.340 --> 02:28.950
I'm oka—

02:28.950 --> 02:30.930
Don't tell me you're okay!

02:30.930 --> 02:35.480
You're crying right now 
because you're not okay at all!

02:38.190 --> 02:41.060
As long as no one's getting hurt, who cares?!

02:41.060 --> 02:45.900
If I give up and just let it happen, 
that's where everything ends!

02:45.900 --> 02:47.810
It doesn't matter anymore!

02:49.250 --> 02:52.320
I can't condone anything that hurts you.

02:53.140 --> 02:57.870
I can't forgive a world that hurts you 
and tries to crush your dream.

02:58.400 --> 03:01.420
I'll be the only wound you need,

03:01.420 --> 03:03.970
the scar that stops you from giving up.

03:04.580 --> 03:08.160
Even if you resent me or hate me,

03:08.160 --> 03:11.260
I'll keep wishing for your 
happiness over and over.

03:12.570 --> 03:16.640
Miss Anis, I want you to be happy.

03:16.640 --> 03:20.160
Happier than anyone in this world.

03:26.050 --> 03:28.840
That goes for me, too.

03:30.350 --> 03:33.580
Aerial Attack: Dragon Heart!

03:38.030 --> 03:40.730
I won't just let you suffer!

03:41.110 --> 03:43.300
That's why I can't let you win!

03:43.300 --> 03:44.710
I don't want to lose!

03:45.990 --> 03:50.300
If this is what it takes to 
stop your tears, I won't lose.

03:51.250 --> 03:53.380
I'll accept all of it!

03:57.000 --> 03:59.290
Gather and combine.

04:07.320 --> 04:09.610
Combine... and be!

04:13.310 --> 04:14.440
That's...

04:15.790 --> 04:18.720
It has been done.

04:20.030 --> 04:21.240
Miss Anis!

04:22.640 --> 04:26.160
This is the power within me 
that you showed to me!

04:26.160 --> 04:28.360
It's the future you dreamed of!

04:28.360 --> 04:31.220
No matter how many times you try to give up,

04:31.220 --> 04:32.570
I will show it to you!

04:40.080 --> 04:41.710
Arc-en-Ciel!

05:21.420 --> 05:22.680
Miss Anis.

05:28.790 --> 05:31.900
That was... so beautiful.

05:35.660 --> 05:38.550
There's no way I could beat that.

05:40.790 --> 05:41.970
Euphie...

05:42.570 --> 05:43.400
Yes?

05:45.470 --> 05:48.860
You're not fair. You're just not fair!

05:49.630 --> 05:54.840
Miss Anis, it was you 
who brought me this far.

05:55.360 --> 05:57.570
I couldn't have made it alone.

05:58.050 --> 06:02.730
I couldn't have loved the world 
this much on my own.

06:03.300 --> 06:08.550
The world only looks so beautiful 
because you're in it.

06:09.240 --> 06:12.350
If you also think it's beautiful, 
then please...

06:13.120 --> 06:15.720
love yourself, too.

06:18.490 --> 06:23.330
Euphie... I... I...

06:23.850 --> 06:24.930
I'm sorry.

06:25.610 --> 06:28.060
I'm not okay.

06:28.060 --> 06:30.670
There's no way I can be okay!

06:38.450 --> 06:41.050
I will hold your hand.

06:41.770 --> 06:43.890
I need you.

06:46.180 --> 06:49.410
You, and no one else.

07:15.260 --> 07:17.450
Anis, I—

07:17.450 --> 07:18.550
Mother...

07:19.540 --> 07:20.790
I'm sorry.

07:21.660 --> 07:25.710
I really don't think I can be queen.

07:27.120 --> 07:32.790
I always knew you condemned yourself 
because I can't use magic,

07:33.510 --> 07:37.050
so I thought I should at least take that 
off your back by becoming queen...

07:38.010 --> 07:42.210
and that if I didn't, I couldn't call myself 
the daughter of you and Father.

07:43.300 --> 07:45.230
I'm sorry for being a useless dau—

07:49.640 --> 07:52.350
How could you call yourself useless?

07:52.350 --> 07:56.630
You're a far better daughter 
than I could ever deserve!

07:57.370 --> 07:58.810
Mother...

07:59.450 --> 08:02.890
You've been trying so hard all this time.

08:02.890 --> 08:06.530
But you don't have to try hard 
by yourself anymore.

08:06.930 --> 08:09.840
Can I really stay as a princess?

08:10.590 --> 08:13.010
As your and Father's daughter?

08:42.000 --> 08:44.190
Euphie, are you still awake?

08:45.120 --> 08:46.660
Miss Anis?

08:47.660 --> 08:50.630
Oh... S-Sorry to bother you so late.

08:51.710 --> 08:54.590
No, I don't mind at all.

09:03.590 --> 09:06.580
I wanted to say... sorry, 
I guess. And thank you.

09:14.520 --> 09:18.560
There's a reason I was so 
hung up on being queen,

09:18.560 --> 09:21.710
and being the daughter 
of my mother and father.

09:22.150 --> 09:23.750
A reason?

09:24.970 --> 09:26.890
I kept it a secret all this time.

09:27.440 --> 09:31.100
A secret I never shared with anyone.

09:31.500 --> 09:35.800
Anyone? Not even Ilia or Tilty?

09:36.390 --> 09:37.110
Yeah.

09:37.880 --> 09:40.910
You're the first person 
I ever thought of telling it to.

09:42.290 --> 09:45.470
I planned to take it with me to my grave.

09:47.310 --> 09:48.330
Euphie...

09:49.500 --> 09:53.890
Will you take this secret 
to the grave with me?

09:56.730 --> 09:58.870
Yes. I promise.

10:02.080 --> 10:05.610
I have memories from a past life.

10:07.070 --> 10:10.560
I lived in a completely different world 
from this one.

10:10.560 --> 10:14.090
Magic only existed in fairy tales there.

10:15.380 --> 10:18.500
When I saw that magic existed in this world,

10:18.500 --> 10:20.620
I thought it seemed like a dream.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.540
Sometimes I wished it <i>was</i> a dream.

10:29.280 --> 10:30.780
Miss Anis?

10:32.580 --> 10:37.690
Am I really Anisphia Wynn Palettia at all?

10:39.870 --> 10:44.370
On the inside, I'm not simply 
"Anisphia Wynn Palettia."

10:45.630 --> 10:52.090
I wondered if my being reborn here 
erased the original Anisphia—

10:53.420 --> 10:57.890
if I took their daughter away from them.

10:59.310 --> 11:03.520
When I thought of that... it scared me.

11:04.960 --> 11:07.480
I thought, I must be just a fake...

11:10.220 --> 11:13.940
There's no way you're just a fake!

11:15.400 --> 11:18.200
You're the one who reached out 
your hand to me!

11:18.560 --> 11:22.600
The one who pulled me from 
the depths of despair that day

11:22.600 --> 11:24.470
was the you who's sitting here now!

11:25.300 --> 11:28.320
It's right here, isn't it? 
Everything you felt,

11:28.320 --> 11:29.510
everything you wished for,

11:30.030 --> 11:31.730
everything you wanted... All of it!

11:34.390 --> 11:39.050
The you that you know, 
and the you that cares about me,

11:39.050 --> 11:41.070
is undeniably right here.

11:41.880 --> 11:44.290
So please don't call yourself a fake!

11:45.680 --> 11:50.920
To me, you are the greatest 
magician in the whole world!

11:57.100 --> 11:58.390
Thank you.

12:28.710 --> 12:31.830
Wh-Why did you kiss me?! You dummy!

12:31.830 --> 12:33.680
Because I wanted to.

12:33.680 --> 12:38.440
W-Wanted to?! You should only 
kiss the person you love!

12:39.720 --> 12:40.900
I do love you.

12:41.720 --> 12:47.400
B-But just, like, out of respect 
and friendship, right?! It has to be!

12:48.870 --> 12:54.030
If it's what you want, I will offer you 
my loyalty and friendship.

12:59.630 --> 13:05.250
But if you can, I'd like you to 
accept this feeling for what it is.

13:05.250 --> 13:07.470
Euphie, wait...

13:08.590 --> 13:09.700
I won't wait.

13:18.010 --> 13:21.110
Euphyllia has completed the spirit contract

13:21.110 --> 13:23.970
and been recognized as a member 
of the royal family.

13:28.290 --> 13:30.040
The time is right.

13:30.810 --> 13:33.620
I am going to step down.

13:40.670 --> 13:45.020
I entrust you to be the next ruler 
of this kingdom, Euphyllia.

13:45.020 --> 13:46.540
Yes, Father.

13:46.930 --> 13:48.390
I accept.

13:48.940 --> 13:50.040
Anis...

13:51.430 --> 13:54.820
You are to support the queen 
as her older sister from now on.

13:54.820 --> 13:57.120
Accompany her in forging ahead to the future.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.220
Yes, Father.

13:59.770 --> 14:02.850
My future is with Euphie.

14:04.020 --> 14:07.200
Now, what sort of ruler will you be,

14:07.200 --> 14:09.290
and how will you build up this kingdom?

14:12.580 --> 14:16.190
I will bring a proper end 
to the current age of magic

14:16.190 --> 14:18.530
and the traditions we have 
kept for generations.

14:18.530 --> 14:21.740
That is my purpose for becoming queen.

14:22.050 --> 14:25.100
And I will build an age in which 
magic is accessible to anyone,

14:25.100 --> 14:28.820
not just to the nobility 
as their exclusive privilege.

14:28.820 --> 14:30.740
And the one to bring that age will be...

14:32.400 --> 14:33.480
I want...

14:35.240 --> 14:37.170
If I must put it into words,

14:37.170 --> 14:39.270
I want to expand freedom to all.

14:42.000 --> 14:43.390
I see.

14:43.650 --> 14:45.970
I would love to see such a kingdom myself.

14:46.690 --> 14:49.190
I know the two of you can do it.

14:53.050 --> 14:57.360
Still, while it may be freedom, 
it's difficult to picture.

14:57.360 --> 15:00.970
A rift separates the way
nobles and commoners think.

15:00.970 --> 15:03.990
Complete understanding 
will not come quickly.

15:03.990 --> 15:05.100
Regarding that...

15:05.580 --> 15:07.920
I have a suggestion.

15:58.340 --> 16:00.770
Okay, this is the last delivery.

16:02.080 --> 16:04.520
What? Was there still something else?

16:08.300 --> 16:09.700
Is this...

16:10.120 --> 16:12.200
I requested it.

16:13.280 --> 16:15.290
A magic sword just for you.

16:15.290 --> 16:15.860
Huh?

16:20.400 --> 16:22.280
What is its name?

16:26.460 --> 16:27.810
"Celestial."

16:28.460 --> 16:30.620
It means "of the skies."

16:34.600 --> 16:37.570
Since my Arc-en-Ciel means "rainbow,"

16:37.570 --> 16:39.590
I wanted a name close in meaning.

16:44.030 --> 16:46.460
A rainbow and the sky, huh?

16:46.460 --> 16:48.070
You're right. They do match.

16:48.070 --> 16:53.480
I think it's perfect for the first person 
in the world to think about ways to fly.

17:13.950 --> 17:15.120
They're flying!

17:15.120 --> 17:17.220
People other than Miss Anis can fly now!

17:20.730 --> 17:24.680
Everyone, thank you very much 
for your generous applause.

17:24.930 --> 17:28.850
Okay, the next thing I have 
to show you is... this!

17:32.520 --> 17:36.620
A dress and coat that give anyone 
wearing them the ability to fly!

17:37.000 --> 17:41.870
We will now give a demonstration 
of flight and aerial dancing.

17:44.130 --> 17:48.420
This is the new shape we wish 
to give to this kingdom.

17:48.820 --> 17:54.390
Endless potential, unbound by 
established concepts and stereotypes.

17:54.680 --> 17:55.840
That is freedom!

18:03.110 --> 18:04.330
Hey, Euphie...

18:05.540 --> 18:07.250
I'll live a long life, okay?

18:08.030 --> 18:09.810
Please do.

18:10.550 --> 18:12.540
I'll do something about 
the immortality, too.

18:13.220 --> 18:14.920
I'll study my hardest.

18:14.920 --> 18:17.940
If nothing else, I could always 
become immortal, too.

18:17.940 --> 18:19.330
I look forward to it.

18:20.200 --> 18:23.030
So stay with me forever, okay?

18:23.470 --> 18:24.260
I will.

18:25.120 --> 18:26.660
Together forever.

18:50.800 --> 18:51.730
Euphie...

18:52.780 --> 18:53.980
Let's go!

18:54.500 --> 18:56.430
Yes, Miss Anis!

19:20.060 --> 19:22.820
Fly!

20:00.070 --> 20:02.360
<i>The kingdom's history henceforth</i>

20:03.390 --> 20:06.110
<i>would record the name of the queen 
who entrusted the future</i>

20:06.110 --> 20:10.310
<i>to the next generation, 
leading it from the old age to the new.</i>

20:11.290 --> 20:14.270
<i>The queen who, in order to 
correct warped traditions,</i>

20:14.270 --> 20:17.630
<i>achieved the same great undertaking 
as the founding king,</i>

20:17.630 --> 20:21.270
<i>becoming the last noble queen 
and the one to end tradition.</i>

20:21.660 --> 20:25.680
<i>That queen's name was 
Euphyllia Fez Palettia.</i>

20:26.910 --> 20:30.160
<i>And by the queen's side</i>

20:30.160 --> 20:33.560
<i>was the princess who carried 
the original royal family's blood.</i>

20:34.480 --> 20:38.530
<i>An innovator who had been long 
persecuted by tradition,</i>

20:38.530 --> 20:40.880
<i>now the leader of the next generation.</i>

20:41.780 --> 20:44.800
<i>The princess who loved 
magic more than any other,</i>

20:44.800 --> 20:47.690
<i>despite being shunned by 
magic more than any other.</i>

20:48.320 --> 20:53.290
<i>That princess's name was 
Anisphia Wynn Palettia.</i>

20:54.380 --> 20:58.200
<i>These two young ladies closed the gap 
between tradition and revolution.</i>

20:58.710 --> 21:03.780
<i>The people would relate the legend of their 
great accomplishments for years to come.</i>

21:04.320 --> 21:07.980
<i>But all of that is yet to come.</i>

21:08.280 --> 21:13.670
<i>Their revolution, after all, 
has only just begun.</i>

21:14.990 --> 21:16.280
Place in the sky...

21:16.700 --> 21:17.900
...a rainbow!

21:30.080 --> 21:32.030
Shower all those...

21:32.030 --> 21:33.690
...who reside in this kingdom...

21:34.390 --> 21:35.870
...with blessings!

21:51.020 --> 21:54.580
Really, Miss Anis! You slept much too late!

21:54.580 --> 21:56.160
Your breakfast will get cold!

21:56.160 --> 21:58.590
Oh... Sorry, Lainie.

21:58.590 --> 22:00.860
Good morning, Miss Anis.

22:00.860 --> 22:02.130
Morning, Euphie.

22:03.350 --> 22:07.080
You don't need to call me "Miss" anymore, 
but you still do.

22:07.390 --> 22:08.900
It's a habit.

22:08.900 --> 22:11.550
I'll be more careful from now on, Anis.

22:13.510 --> 22:15.370
Thank you.

22:16.570 --> 22:19.930
You seem to have fully acclimated 
to your role as a maid.

22:21.520 --> 22:24.010
It's all thanks to Miss Ilia.

22:24.010 --> 22:26.620
You learn very quickly, Lainie.

22:27.140 --> 22:28.710
You are an apprentice worth teaching.

22:28.710 --> 22:32.000
O-Oh... Not at all...

22:32.000 --> 22:34.260
You have truly been a great help.

22:36.740 --> 22:37.880
Anis?

22:39.210 --> 22:42.070
Nah, it's nothing.

22:43.980 --> 22:46.620
Miss Anisphia, Miss Euphyllia,

22:46.620 --> 22:49.150
you will be late if you don't leave soon.

22:49.150 --> 22:51.310
Huh? It's already that late?!

22:51.310 --> 22:54.430
You take too long to eat, Miss Anis!

22:57.300 --> 22:58.850
Oh, Euphie...

23:04.600 --> 23:05.480
Here.

23:10.470 --> 23:15.030
When will you kiss me 
on the lips instead, I wonder?

23:15.030 --> 23:17.300
I-I don't know!

23:22.510 --> 23:23.950
Euphie!

23:24.850 --> 23:27.430
We'll be late, Anis!

23:36.180 --> 23:39.930
Episode Twelve







Their Magical Revolution
